  "notes": "{盛|も}る means to heap up or serve food into a container.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: ⟦ご{飯|はん}→ご飯：00776_gohan⟧を{盛|も}る\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦ご{飯|はん}→ご飯：00776_gohan⟧を{盛|も}る: to serve rice\n- ⟦{盛|も}り{付|つ}け→盛り付け：05754_moritsuke⟧: presentation, arrangement (of food)\n- ⟦{大盛|おおも}り→大盛り：08162_oomori⟧: large serving\n- ⟦{山盛|やまも}り→山盛り：10157_yamamori⟧: heaping portion\n- てんこ{盛|も}り: piled high\n\nWATCH OUT:\n⟦{毒|どく}→毒：10052_doku⟧を{盛|も}る means 'to poison (someone)' - putting poison in food/drink.",
